10032513,2024-09-05,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I am writing to formally lodge a complaint against several credit reporting agencies for what I believe to be violations of federal laws concerning the reporting and disclosure of my credit information. My concerns are based on violations of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), the Privacy Act of 1974, the Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act as well as 15 USC 1681 where the credit that is reporting should be 100 % accurate.

