I attempted to communicate with Planet through written correspondence on several occasions. After submission of all my correspondence, I only received communication back once. 

I have also obtained the cusip number relevant to this mortgage loan and there appears to be fraudulent activity to include trading activity in real time. There is significant evidence that indicates that this loan has been satisfied by the check that was presented to the Treasury window on my behalf when the account was opened in my name. Sadly, this information failed to be disclosed to me. 

I also have suspicions that Planet Home Lending is engaging in organized crime. I submitted a written RESPA request via certified mail # XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX to investigate the origination of this mortgage loan from its inception to date. This written RESPA request was submitted on XX/XX/XXXX. These concerns will also be forwarded to the IRS via XXXX XXXX, the FTC, and the SEC. 

In addition, this has had an adverse effect on my credit report due to the negative credit reporting which has deemed me as a potential risk to other creditors. 

