10194674,2024-09-19,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"I am writing to address the adverse marks on my credit file that have been attributed to me. While I would willingly acknowledge and assume responsibility for any valid debts, I am unable to do so in this case without Proper Validation and Proof Of Claim. As per the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), I am formally requesting comprehensive validation of the alleged debt. 
