10237848,2024-09-26,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Difficulty submitting a dispute or getting information about a dispute over the phone,"Following significant data breaches, including those by XXXX XXXX XXXX and XXXX, my personal information was exposed, leading to identity theft. Starting in XX/XX/year>, my credit report was impacted by several unauthorized inquiries and the opening of a business account, which I did not consent to. Entities such as XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX, XXXX, and XXXX were involved, and an unauthorized business line of credit was charged off as bad debt with a balance of {$650.00} by XX/XX/year>. 

